  "id": "beetroot-salad-with-pickled-stalks",
  "name": "Beetroot Salad with Pickled Stalks",
  "subtitle": "Roasted beetroot, lentils, herbs, and a sharp creamy dressing",
  "description": "A warm-season salad combining tender roasted beetroot, tangy pickled stalks, puy lentils, fresh mint, and horseradish cream. Serve with hot smoked fish if desired.",
  "meal_type": "salad",
  "yield": {
